# Server and web SDKs: two packages each

`sdks/node` publishes `@fireweaveai/server-sdk` and `@fireweaveai/server-sdk-cjs`; `sdks/web`
publishes `@fireweaveai/web-sdk` and `@fireweaveai/web-sdk-cjs`. The `-cjs` twins are built from
the same source by `tools/typescript/twins/build-cjs-twin.mjs` (ADR-0014). Every change here ships in both.

Before saying a change is done, committing, or opening a PR:

1. `cd sdks/node && npm run verify` or `cd sdks/web && bun run verify`.
2. `tools/typescript/twins/verify-twins.sh node|web|all` for every package touched.
3. Paste both results into the PR. A red gate blocks the change; never weaken or skip a check.

Never edit `build/cjs/` or a twin manifest by hand. No top-level `await`, `import.meta`,
`export =` or ESM-only runtime dependency. Full rules: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
